DESCRIPTION:Steve Wrigley returns with a brand‑new hour of gloriously ner
 dy stand‑up. Originally from New Zealand\, Steve has built a devoted Inst
 agram following thanks to his sharp\, joyful riffs on geek‑core obsession
 s like Dungeons & Dragons\, Lord of the Rings\, and the strange magic of fa
 ndom culture.\n\nThis new show brings all the things audiences love about h
 im: quick‑fire crowd work\, off‑the‑rails improvisation\, and stories
  that feel both wildly imaginative and painfully relatable. If you’ve eve
 r rolled a d20\, argued about hobbits\, or simply enjoyed watching a grown 
 man spiral into delightful chaos\, this is your night.\n\nCouples Package i
 ncludes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person
 )\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimu
 m in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drink items fro
 m the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge
  do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the righ
 t to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive 
 or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-a
